<title>USA: Norrell completes Comtex acquisition.</title>
<headline>Norrell completes Comtex acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norrell Corp on Thursday said it completed its acquisition of Comtex Information Systems Inc, a New York-based provider of information technology and enterprise consulting services.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Comtex's services include systems planning and development, organizational consulting related to business transformation, and staff augmentation support, Norrell said.</p>
